    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_612> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_612_obligation_0_3c2f6c65_period_a5947c46fa> a dznorm:Period ;
