    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_689> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_689_obligation_0_3cbedfc1> a dznorm:Obligation ;
