    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_755> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_755_obligation_0_c937a95b_period_c68ebb676f> a dznorm:Period ;
