    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_772> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-02-25/08-09#art_772_condition_1_6e2cc636> a dznorm:Condition ;
